 029T 'stands for any character.'(TU)
/
/
 001T 'example:'(TU)
 015T '*String%String*'(YEI)
/
/
 001T 'Note: NOM now also provides full support of NATURAL masks, so'(TU)
/
 007T '*'(YEI)
 009T 'may not only be used as wildcard but also as string.'(TU)
/
/
 001T 'example:'(TU)
 015T 'MASK(*''String''*''*** ''NNN'' ***''*''String''*)'(YEI)
